 minimize resource fragmentation.\n\n2. **No Visibility Data**: The satellites have empty future coordinates, meaning we cannot calculate visibility duration. The longest_duration_allocation heuristic requires this information to function properly.\n\n3. **Early Simulation Phase**: At Step 5, we're establishing the initial allocation pattern. best_fit_allocation will create a balanced distribution across processing units.\n\n4. **Resource Constraints**: Applications have varying CPU/Memory demands (CPU: 11-48, Memory: 10-43). best_fit_allocation will ensure smaller applications fill gaps in larger ones.\n\n## Expected Allocation Pattern:\n\nThe algorithm will likely allocate applications to processing units in order of:\n- **Smallest remaining capacity first** (after each allocation)\n- **Best fit for each application's resource requirements**\n- **Balanced load distribution** across all 5 processing units\n\nThis approach will maximize resource utilization and prevent any single processing unit from becoming overloaded while others remain underutilized.", 'from_history': False, 'stop_after_tool_call': False, 'role': 'assistant', 'metrics': {'input_tokens': 3313, 'output_tokens': 1033, 'total_tokens': 4346, 'duration': 707.1017613469994, 'time_to_first_token': 707.1017613469994, 'provider_metrics': {'total_duration': 707100107938, 'load_duration': 343964847, 'prompt_eval_duration': 228246467105, 'eval_duration': 477670520034}}, 'created_at': 1779402122}], 'tools': [], 'input': {'input_content': "Current State:\n\n    ### Current Simulation State\n    - **Step**: 5\n    \n    **Satellites:** {'ID: 1': {'Previous Coordinates': [6.1013, -58.1339, 454.632], 'Current Coordinates': [6.1013, -58.1339, 454.632], 'Future Coordinates': [], 'Max Connection Range': 1500, 'Status': 'Available'}, 'ID: 2': {'Previous Coordinates': [-18.6629, -65.9614, 552.6416], 'Current Coordinates': [-18.6629, -65.9614, 552.6416], 'Future Coordinates': [], 'Max Connection Range': 1500, 'Status':